@startuml 09_seq_pembatalan_reservasi

' ============================================================
' SISTEM INFORMASI RESERVASI RAMA HOMESTAY
' Diagram Sequence #5: Pembatalan Reservasi
' Standar  : UML 2.5 (BCE: Boundary - Control - Entity)
' Tema     : Hitam Putih (Monochrome) Standar Formal RPL & Skripsi
' ============================================================

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam rightMargin 40
skinparam leftMargin 30
skinparam topMargin 25
skinparam bottomMargin 25

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowThickness 1.2
    ActorBorderThickness 1.5
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    ParticipantBorderThickness 1.2
    ParticipantPadding 15
}

header Sistem Informasi Reservasi Rama Homestay
title DIAGRAM SEQUENCE: PEMBATALAN RESERVASI (MANDIRI & OTOMATIS EXPIRED)

autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"

actor "Tamu" as Tamu
boundary "View Dasbor Tamu\n(tamu/dashboard.blade)" as View
control "ReservationController" as ResCtrl
entity "Reservation\n(Model)" as ResModel
database "Database MySQL" as DB

== Skenario 1: Pembatalan Mandiri oleh Tamu ==

Tamu -> View : Klik tombol "Batalkan Pemesanan" pada transaksi berstatus pending
activate View

View -> ResCtrl : POST /tamu/cancel/{id}
activate ResCtrl

ResCtrl -> ResModel : where('id', $id)->where('user_id', Auth::id())->firstOrFail()
activate ResModel
ResModel -> DB : SELECT * FROM reservations WHERE id=? AND user_id=?
activate DB
DB --> ResModel : Data reservasi milik tamu
deactivate DB
ResModel --> ResCtrl : Objek $reservation
deactivate ResModel

alt #White [Status Reservasi == 'pending']
    ResCtrl -> ResModel : update(['status' => 'cancelled'])
    activate ResModel
    ResModel -> DB : UPDATE reservations SET status='cancelled' WHERE id=?
    activate DB
    DB --> ResModel : Status berhasil diubah ke cancelled
    deactivate DB
    ResModel --> ResCtrl : Sukses dibatalkan
    deactivate ResModel

    ResCtrl --> View : Redirect back() dengan notifikasi sukses "Reservasi berhasil dibatalkan"
    View --> Tamu : Tampilkan pesan sukses & perbarui label status menjadi CANCELLED

else #White [Status Reservasi != 'pending' (Misal: Confirmed / Completed)]
    ResCtrl --> View : Redirect back() withErrors("Pemesanan lunas tidak dapat dibatalkan mandiri")
    View --> Tamu : Tampilkan pesan peringatan penolakan pembatalan
end

deactivate ResCtrl
deactivate View

== Skenario 2: Pembatalan Otomatis oleh Sistem (Auto Expired 30 Menit) ==

note over Tamu, DB : Terpicu otomatis setiap kali ada pengecekan ketersediaan atau akses pemesanan
Tamu -> ResCtrl : Mengakses katalog / cek ketersediaan kamar
activate ResCtrl

ResCtrl -> ResModel : releaseExpiredReservations()
activate ResModel

ResModel -> DB : UPDATE reservations SET status='cancelled' WHERE status='pending' AND expires_at <= NOW()
activate DB
DB --> ResModel : N baris data pending kedaluwarsa dibatalkan
deactivate DB

ResModel --> ResCtrl : return jumlah kuota yang otomatis dibebaskan kembali
deactivate ResModel

ResCtrl --> Tamu : Sistem siap melayani pemesanan dengan kuota terkini
deactivate ResCtrl

@enduml
